get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/players/online?limit=100
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## Online players

  List characters that are currently in the world.

  - Method and path: `GET /api/v1/players/online?limit=100`.
  - Auth: valid HMAC signature only; no `X-GM-Actor` and no RBAC permission.
  - Query: `limit` is 1-500; values above 500 clamp to 500; invalid or missing values use 100.
  - Success: `200` with an array of
    `{"guid","name","account_id","level","race","class","map","zone"}`, ordered by GUID.
  - Failure: `401` bad signature, `405` wrong method, `409` replayed nonce, `429` rate limited,
    `503 world_unavailable`.

  Empty array means no character is in the world.
}
